---
import { MILESTONES } from '../../data/milestones';
import { FORMULAS } from '../../data/formulas';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const milestone = MILESTONES[5];
const ramanujan = FORMULAS.ramanujan;
---

<section 
  id="scene-6" 
  class="scene" 
  data-scene="ramanujan" 
  data-year={milestone.year}
  data-pi-value={milestone.piApproximation}
  data-theme={milestone.theme}
  data-scene-title={milestone.title[locale]}
>
  <div class="stage">
    <!-- Narrative beats -->
    <div class="narrative">
      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.05-0.38">
        <span class="scene-kicker">06 // CAMBRIDGE, 1914 d.C.</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">{milestone.title[locale]}</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'Srinivasa Ramanujan llegó a Cambridge con cuadernos repletos de fórmulas que parecían surgir de otra dimensión. Entre ellas, una serie infinita tan violenta que cambió para siempre el cálculo numérico.'
            : 'Srinivasa Ramanujan arrived at Cambridge with notebooks bursting with formulas that seemed plucked from another realm. Among them, an infinite series so fierce it redefined numerical analysis forever.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.42-0.95">
        <span class="scene-kicker">06 // CONVERGENCIA MONSTRUOSA</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">8 Decimales Nuevos por Término</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'Mientras las fórmulas clásicas tardaban miles de iteraciones en ganar un solo decimal, cada término k de Ramanujan clava 8 decimales exactos de golpe. Con k = 0, el universo de π ya está a su merced.'
            : 'While classical formulas crawled through thousands of iterations for a single digit, every term k of Ramanujan nails 8 exact decimals in one shot. With k = 0, π is already at his command.'}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Ramanujan Formula & Term Breakdown Rig -->
    <div class="formula-rig" id="ramanujan-rig">
      <!-- Master Formula Box -->
      <div class="formula-card">
        <div class="formula-expression">
          <span class="lhs">1 / π</span>
          <span class="eq">=</span>
          <span class="factor">
            <span class="f-num">2√2</span>
            <span class="f-bar"></span>
            <span class="f-den">9801</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sigma">∑</span>
          <span class="term-expr">
            <span class="t-num">(4k)! · (1103 + 26390k)</span>
            <span class="t-bar"></span>
            <span class="t-den">(k!)⁴ · 396⁴ᵏ</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparison Deck for k = 0 and k = 1 -->
      <div class="comparison-deck">
        <!-- k = 0 step -->
        <div class="step-card step-k0" id="card-k0">
          <div class="step-header">
            <span class="step-badge">PRIMER TÉRMINO (k = 0)</span>
            <span class="step-rate">+8 DECIMALES EXACTOS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-math">
            1/π ≈ (2√2 / 9801) · 1103
          </div>
          <div class="digits-strip">
            <span class="d-match">3.141592</span><span class="d-mismatch">73...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-meta">
            <span>Precisión:</span>
            <strong class="emerald-text">99.999997% (Error &lt; 10⁻⁷)</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- k = 1 step (activates as --p advances) -->
        <div class="step-card step-k1" id="card-k1">
          <div class="step-header">
            <span class="step-badge">SEGUNDO TÉRMINO (k = 1)</span>
            <span class="step-rate">+16 DECIMALES EXACTOS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-math">
            1/π ≈ (2√2 / 9801) · [ 1103 + 27493 / 24591257856 ]
          </div>
          <div class="digits-strip">
            <span class="d-match">3.141592653589793</span><span class="d-mismatch">87...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-meta">
            <span>Precisión:</span>
            <strong class="emerald-text">16 cifras exactas (Error &lt; 10⁻¹⁵)</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const rig = document.getElementById('ramanujan-rig');
  const cardK1 = document.getElementById('card-k1');

  if (rig && cardK1) {
    const scene = rig.closest('[data-scene]') as HTMLElement | null;
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      if (!scene) return;
      const p = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(scene).getPropertyValue('--p')) || 0;
      cardK1.classList.toggle('is-unlocked', p > 0.45);
    }, { passive: true });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .scene {
    height: 380vh;
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #0d1a16 0%, #070d0b 100%);
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .narrative {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10vh;
    max-width: 680px;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .beat {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate3d(0, 16px, 0);
    transition: opacity 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
  }

  .beat.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .scene-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #00ffaa;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .beat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.6vw, 1.05rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .formula-rig {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 18vh;
    width: min(92vw, 780px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .formula-card {
    background: rgba(13, 26, 22, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 170, 0.25);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 170, 0.05);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .formula-expression {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    color: #f0fdf4;
  }

  .factor, .term-expr {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .f-bar, .t-bar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: currentColor;
    margin: 3px 0;
  }

  .f-num, .f-den, .t-num, .t-den {
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  .sigma {
    font-size: 2.2em;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #00ffaa;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 4px;
  }

  .comparison-deck {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .step-card {
    background: rgba(18, 30, 26, 0.75);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .step-k1 {
    opacity: 0.4;
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .step-k1.is-unlocked {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1);
    border-color: rgba(0, 255, 170, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 255, 170, 0.15);
  }

  .step-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .step-badge {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .step-rate {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: #00ffaa;
    background: rgba(0, 255, 170, 0.1);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .step-math {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .digits-strip {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    border-radius: 6px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .d-match {
    color: #00ffaa;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 170, 0.5);
  }

  .d-mismatch {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .step-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .emerald-text {
    color: #00ffaa;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .comparison-deck {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
